		{"id":"script-nl","type":"text","x":600,"y":310,"width":400,"height":280,"color":"3","text":"## Newsletter Draft\n**Status:** drafting\n\n### Structure\n- [ ] Subject line (A/B options)\n- [ ] Opening hook\n- [ ] Body / insight\n- [ ] CTA\n- [ ] PS line\n\n**Word count target:** ~600–900"},
		{"id":"production-yt","type":"text","x":1200,"y":0,"width":400,"height":300,"color":"2","text":"## YouTube Production\n**Status:** recording / editing\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] Record footage\n- [ ] Record voiceover / B-roll\n- [ ] Edit in DaVinci / Premiere\n- [ ] Add captions\n- [ ] Create thumbnail\n- [ ] Write description + tags\n- [ ] Schedule upload"},
		{"id":"production-nl","type":"text","x":1200,"y":330,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"2","text":"## Newsletter Production\n**Status:** finalizing\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] Paste into email platform\n- [ ] Add images / formatting\n- [ ] Test send to self\n- [ ] Check links\n- [ ] Set send time"},
		{"id":"review-yt","type":"text","x":1800,"y":0,"width":400,"height":250,"color":"1","text":"## YouTube Review\n**Status:** review\n\n### Quality Check\n- [ ] Watch full cut end-to-end\n- [ ] Audio levels OK\n- [ ] Captions accurate\n- [ ] Thumbnail eye-catching\n- [ ] Description SEO'd\n- [ ] Cards / end screen set"},
		{"id":"review-nl","type":"text","x":1800,"y":280,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"1","text":"## Newsletter Review\n**Status:** review\n\n### Quality Check\n- [ ] Subject line punchy?\n- [ ] Mobile preview OK\n- [ ] No broken links\n- [ ] Plain-text version\n- [ ] Unsubscribe link present"},
